Round-trip test model with filled universes
c Level-0 cells. Between them these cover every placement `migrate` has to
c round-trip: a bare fill, a fill through a named transformation, a starred
c fill with an inline transformation, and a cell with no fill at all.
1  0        -1      imp:n=1 fill=1
2  0         1 -2   imp:n=1 fill=2 (30)
3  0         2 -3   imp:n=1 *fill=1 (0 0 5)
4  0         3 -4   imp:n=1
5  0         4      imp:n=0
c Universe 1
10 5 -1.00  -10     imp:n=1 u=1
11 0         10     imp:n=1 u=1
c Universe 2
20 6 -7.87  -20     imp:n=1 u=2
21 0         20     imp:n=1 u=2

1  SO 10
2  SO 20
3  SO 30
4  SO 40
10 SO 4
20 SO 6

TR30 0 0 5
M5 1001 1
M6 26056 1
F4:N 1
MODE N
NPS 1000
SDEF pos 0 0 0
